      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.17 (vs ₹1.29 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.17 (down from ₹1.29 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹360.9m (up 2.7% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹107.8m (down 9.5% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 30% (down from 34% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 1% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 18% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
